{"id":"concept-抽象观念","slug":"抽象观念","entityType":"concept","name":"抽象观念","originalTerms":["abstract ideas"],"summary":"贝克莱批评把一般词理解为对应一个剥去一切个别特征的心像。人可以用一般词处理许多个别情形，却不必拥有“抽象三角形”或“抽象物质”这样的对象。","senses":[{"traditionId":"tradition-经验主义","label":"抽象观念","explanation":"这项批评针对的不是概括能力，而是把概括误作无差别心像的哲学理论。它为贝克莱批评物质实体清除了一条语言和心理学上的前提。","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-berkeley-principles-1710","locator":"Introduction, §§6–25","claim":"支持抽象观念批评及一般词用法。"}]}],"personIds":["george-berkeley"],"workIds":["principles-human-knowledge","three-dialogues-hylas-philonous"],"traditionIds":["tradition-经验主义"],"sourceIds":["src-berkeley","src-berkeley-principles-1710"],"citations":[{"sourceId":"src-berkeley","locator":"Section 2.1","claim":"支持该概念的解释和作用。"}],"contentTier":"standard","editorialStatus":"published","version":1,"editedBy":"思想星图编辑组","reviewedBy":"source-structure-review/journey-batch-v1","lastReviewedAt":"2026-08-05","notes":"不把贝克莱的批评误写成反对一切普遍性或科学。"}
